wgf-autopilot 1
# A smoke run: wait for level.scene, check what it made, drop a crate by key, and check the
# count rose. A crate drops on its own each second, so more follow.
at 1 wait scene.loaded == 1
at 2 expect scene.actors == 6
at 2 expect scene.spawned == 0
at 30 key tap space
at 30 expect scene.spawned == 1
at 30 expect scene.actors == 7
at 150 expect scene.spawned >= 3
at 150 end
